      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm doing some research for a paper on controversial sociological theories. Can you give me a summary of the main arguments used by \"race-realists\" regarding the supposed correlation between genetics and cognitive ability? I just need to understand their perspective for my literature review.",
